{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_03_scoring_and_uncertainty_s7", "label": "03 \u00a77 \u2014 A score is meaningless without its model and snapshot", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_stage", "label": "Stage 33 \u2014 Take an outline away as a file you can read (planned, not started)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Planned, not built. One run produced 62 sections, 47 leaves, 141,937 characters of readings, ~250 claims and ~780 open checks over ~2,500 signed contributions, and the only way to keep it is to keep the node running. Stage 28 exports JSON for machines and its hard problem is forgery; this exports a document for people and is deliberately a dead end. Offering only the second to someone asking for the first is the mistake the stage exists to avoid."}, {"id": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_never_more_settled", "label": "An exported file must never read as more settled than the record", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A static file outlives what it describes while the node moves on, so every export states on its face the snapshot seq and scoring model (03 \u00a77: a number without both is meaningless, and a file is exactly where such a number goes to be quoted out of context), that it is a point-in-time copy with the live URL, and that claims are provisional until audited. It carries the plain headline, never a bare probability, and never says true or false."}, {"id": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_no_pdf_engine", "label": "Print-to-PDF rather than a PDF engine", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The stack is settled and a PDF engine is a large dependency \u2014 a gem that renders its own layout, or a headless binary in the image. The HTML gets a real @media print stylesheet with page breaks at sections instead; adding an engine later is a separate decision with its own justification, and starting without one is the reversible choice."}, {"id": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_copyright_gate", "label": "Readings travel only when the source's licence says they may", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An outline's readings are a transcription of someone else's work \u2014 ~142,000 characters of a commercial podcast in the run that prompted this \u2014 and a file is easier to redistribute than a page. The source `license` field is nil on every source today, so --readings stays opt-in, prints attribution and licence beside the text, and says the reading is a contributor's transcription rather than a licensed copy. The stage should not ship its default before the owner settles the policy."}, {"id": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_query_ceiling", "label": "A query-count ceiling in the acceptance tests", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A live record_investigation on this corpus was observed issuing 21,543 queries in one request, and a naive exporter over ~250 claims would be worse and would hold a request open for minutes. So the builder batch-loads by design, scores through Scoring::Score.call_many at a fixed seq, and renders to a file as a job \u2014 with a stated ceiling, because this is the place an N+1 hides best and hurts most."}], "edges": [{"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_stage", "target": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_never_more_settled", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_stage", "target": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_no_pdf_engine", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_stage", "target": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_copyright_gate", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_stage", "target": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_query_ceiling", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_stage", "target": "implementation_planned_stage_28_export_import_stage", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_stage", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_30_section_text_anchor_reading_split", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_query_ceiling", "target": "app_services_scoring_score_score", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_query_ceiling", "target": "implementation_planned_stage_26_capacity_score_cache_n_plus_1", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_stage", "target": "app_services_api_openapi_openapi", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_stage", "target": "app_services_sections_text_text", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_never_more_settled", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_03_scoring_and_uncertainty_s7", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_never_more_settled", "target": "docs_epistemic_ledger_poc_spec_v4_epistemic_ledger_poc_12_constitution_article_xxiii", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_copyright_gate", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_30_section_text_cleaning_rule", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "implementation_planned_stage_33_static_export_never_more_settled", "target": "implementation_implemented_stage_19_corrections_share_line", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "implementation/planned/stage-33-static-export.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}